[Quotes]
victory0 = "I need a reason to fight? How 'bout your ugly mugs!";96
victory1 = "Thought yourselves heroes, huh? It's so funny, I'm crying!"
victory2 = "I can beat you with one finger! Now stay out of my way, trash!"
victory3 = "How's that? Now understand what I am big at, don't you?";98UM
victory4 = "BOR-ING Come back after you've seen a real bloodbath!";XI
victory5 = "Did you think you could beat ME?! Humph! You're a conceited one, aren't you?"
victory6 = "Give up already. I'm no match for someone as weak as you."
victory7 = "Heh heh heh. You really took it that round, didn't you?"
victory8 = "Hey, whats the matter? Enjoy yourself, your life is at stake!!"
victory9 = "That's the difference between you and me!! You're better off crawling around on all fours!"
victory10 = "What do you think? Wanna work for me? I'll treat you well..."
victory11 = "You're not totally useless... But at this rate, the best you'll become is a bodyguard."
victory12 = "I'm quite the ambitious one. There's no way winning this competition will satisfy me.";NBC
victory13 = "Nice fight. If you want a bouncing job, I just might hire you."
victory14 = "They call me Mr. Big. That's B-I-G! Burn it into your memory!"
victory15 = "That's one fine way of losing. It would fit perfectly with a blues accompaniment."
victory16 = "What a wimp! I didn't even work up a sweat! Next!";AOF1
victory17 = "Just be grateful I didn't use my plumber's helper, pal!";AOF2
victory18 = "I thought so. The power of my pole is positively preposterous!"
victory19 = "You fought well. Who is your pal, baldy?!";Mr.Big
;vs Ryo
victory20 = "You're not worth anything to me anymore. Get out of here!!";XI
victory21 = "Kyokugen Karate's not what it used to be. Ashamed, are you? Then go cry home to Papa Takuma!";NBC
;vs Robert
victory22 = "You really are a pest. I already returned Takuma's daughter to you, didn't I?";NBC
;vs King
victory23 = "Looks like you've become quite a coward. Pity... You used to be far more interesting.";XI
;vs Geese
victory24 = "Hey, Geese. Good job getting this far. I'll give you a rest... In eternal sleep!";XI
victory25 = "Southtown is mine! And you're leaving it!";NBC
;vs others
victory26 = "Humph. Theres no way Id lose in a kids playground!";XI - Kasumi/Malin/Momoko/Shingo
victory27 = "That's why kids are dangerous. They don't know their ability until they get slapped around.";NBC - Yuki